rs/TheNorthS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T07:07:21Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T07:07:21Z","body":"\n\n\n\n> [@TheNorthS](https://github.com/TheNorthS)该错误发生在哪里？大小为 [31, 2000] 和 [27, 2000] 的张量应由不同的数据加载器处理，因此切勿尝试将它们堆叠在一起。\nIt did occur at the dataloader stage. But I saved the data of channel 19 to an HDF5 file. Why does this problem still arise?\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601543822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601548999","html_url":"https://github.com/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8#issuecomment-2601548999","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8","id":2601548999,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLF0fBs6bEHzH","user":{"login":"TheNorthS","id":79570748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTcwNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79570748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS","html_url":"https://github.com/TheNorthS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T07:08:20Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T07:08:20Z","body":"> [@TheNorthS](https://github.com/TheNorthS) Where did that error occur? Tensors of size [31, 2000] and [27, 2000] should be handled by different data loaders so one should never try to stack them together.\n\nHave you encountered this problem? Could you share the code for your data processing?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601548999/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601723201","html_url":"https://github.com/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8#issuecomment-2601723201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8","id":2601723201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLF0fBs6bEyVB","user":{"login":"ddicee","id":30242033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMjQyMDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30242033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee","html_url":"https://github.com/ddicee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddicee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T08:22:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T08:22:29Z","body":"> It did occur at the dataloader stage. But I saved the data of channel 19 to an HDF5 file. Why does this problem still arise?\n\nIt's hard to tell what's causing the problem without looking at your code. Check two things: 1. The data tensors stored in your hdf5 file have consistent shape. 2. Each hdf5 file is loaded by a separate data loader.\n\n> Have you encountered this problem? Could you share the code for your data processing?\n\nMy code is not ready for sharing. Sorry about that.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601723201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601769285","html_url":"https://github.com/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8#issuecomment-2601769285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8","id":2601769285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLF0fBs6bE9lF","user":{"login":"TheNorthS","id":79570748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTcwNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79570748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS","html_url":"https://github.com/TheNorthS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T08:44:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T08:44:05Z","body":"> > 在dataloader阶段确实出现了这个问题，但是我把19通道的数据保存到HDF5文件中了，为什么还会出现这个问题？\n> \n> 如果不查看代码，很难判断问题的原因。请检查两件事：1. 存储在 hdf5 文件中的数据张量具有一致的形状。2. 每个 hdf5 文件都由单独的数据加载器加载。\n> \n> > 您遇到过这个问题吗？您可以分享一下您的数据处理代码吗？\n> \n> 我的代码还不能共享。抱歉。\n\nl_freq = 0.1\nh_freq = 75.0\nrsfreq = 200\n\n# channel number * rsfreq\nchunks = (17, rsfreq)\nstandard_1020 = [\n    'FP1', 'FPZ', 'FP2',\n    'AF9', 'AF7', 'AF5', 'AF3', 'AF1', 'AFZ', 'AF2', 'AF4', 'AF6', 'AF8', 'AF10', \\\n    'F9', 'F7', 'F5', 'F3', 'F1', 'FZ', 'F2', 'F4', 'F6', 'F8', 'F10', \\\n    'FT9', 'FT7', 'FC5', 'FC3', 'FC1', 'FCZ', 'FC2', 'FC4', 'FC6', 'FT8', 'FT10', \\\n    'T9', 'T7', 'C5', 'C3', 'C1', 'CZ', 'C2', 'C4', 'C6', 'T8', 'T10', \\\n    'TP9', 'TP7', 'CP5', 'CP3', 'CP1', 'CPZ', 'CP2', 'CP4', 'CP6', 'TP8', 'TP10', \\\n    'P9', 'P7', 'P5', 'P3', 'P1', 'PZ', 'P2', 'P4', 'P6', 'P8', 'P10', \\\n    'PO9', 'PO7', 'PO5', 'PO3', 'PO1', 'POZ', 'PO2', 'PO4', 'PO6', 'PO8', 'PO10', \\\n    'O1', 'OZ', 'O2', 'O9', 'CB1', 'CB2', \\\n    'IZ', 'O10', 'T3', 'T5', 'T4', 'T6', 'M1', 'M2', 'A1', 'A2', \\\n    'CFC1', 'CFC2', 'CFC3', 'CFC4', 'CFC5', 'CFC6', 'CFC7', 'CFC8', \\\n    'CCP1', 'CCP2', 'CCP3', 'CCP4', 'CCP5', 'CCP6', 'CCP7', 'CCP8', \\\n    'T1', 'T2', 'FTT9h', 'TTP7h', 'TPP9h', 'FTT10h', 'TPP8h', 'TPP10h', \\\n    \"FP1-F7\", \"F7-T7\", \"T7-P7\", \"P7-O1\", \"FP2-F8\", \"F8-T8\", \"T8-P8\", \"P8-O2\", \"FP1-F3\", \"F3-C3\", \"C3-P3\", \"P3-O1\", \"FP2-F4\", \"F4-C4\", \"C4-P4\", \"P4-O2\"\n]\ndrop_channels = ['PHOTIC','IBI','BURSTS','SUPPR','31','32','SP1','SP2','C3P','C4P','EKG1']\ndataset_base_path = savePath  # 设定基础路径\n\nfor cntFile in group:\n    print(f'processing {cntFile.name}')\n\n    # 读取并处理数据\n    eegData, chOrder = preprocessing_edf(cntFile, l_freq, h_freq, rsfreq, standard_channels=standard_1020)\n\n\n    # 将通道名转换为大写\n    chOrder = [s.upper() for s in chOrder]\n\n    # 截断数据（去掉最后10秒的数据）\n    eegData = eegData[:, :-10 * rsfreq]\n\n    # 如果数据量不足则跳过\n    if eegData.shape[1] <= 10 * rsfreq:\n        print(f\"Skipping {cntFile.name}: not enough data after truncation.\")\n        continue\n\n    # 根据通道数创建文件夹（如果不存在的话）\n    channel_count = len(chOrder)\n    specific_save_path = os.path.join(dataset_base_path, f'{channel_count}_channels')  # 创建基于通道数的路径\n    os.makedirs(specific_save_path, exist_ok=True)  # 如果路径不存在则创建\n    specific_save_path=Path(specific_save_path)  # 转换为Path对象\n    # 为每个通道数创建一个新的dataset文件\n    dataset = h5Dataset(specific_save_path, 'dataset')\n\n    # 添加数据到dataset\n    grp = dataset.addGroup(grpName=cntFile.stem)\n\n    dset = dataset.addDataset(grp, 'eeg', eegData, chunks)\n\n    # 添加属性\n    dataset.addAttributes(dset, 'lFreq', l_freq)\n    dataset.addAttributes(dset, 'hFreq', h_freq)\n    dataset.addAttributes(dset, 'rsFreq', rsfreq)\n    dataset.addAttributes(dset, 'chOrder', chOrder)\n\n    # 保存dataset\n    dataset.save()\n\nprint(\"所有数据已保存。\")这是我处理的代码\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601769285/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601771786","html_url":"https://github.com/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8#issuecomment-2601771786","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8","id":2601771786,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLF0fBs6bE-MK","user":{"login":"TheNorthS","id":79570748,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTcwNzQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79570748?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS","html_url":"https://github.com/TheNorthS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheNorthS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T08:44:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T08:44:56Z","body":"> > 在dataloader阶段确实出现了这个问题，但是我把19通道的数据保存到HDF5文件中了，为什么还会出现这个问题？\n> \n> 如果不查看代码，很难判断问题的原因。请检查两件事：1. 存储在 hdf5 文件中的数据张量具有一致的形状。2. 每个 hdf5 文件都由单独的数据加载器加载。\n> \n> > 您遇到过这个问题吗？您可以分享一下您的数据处理代码吗？\n> \n> 我的代码还不能共享。抱歉。\n\ndef preprocessing_edf(edfFilePath, l_freq=0.1, h_freq=75.0, sfreq:int=200, drop_channels: list=None, standard_channels: list=None):\n    # reading edf\n    raw = mne.io.read_raw_edf(edfFilePath, preload=True)\n    # if drop_channels is not None:\n    #     useless_chs = []\n    #     for ch in drop_channels:\n    #         if ch in raw.ch_names:\n    #             useless_chs.append(ch)\n    #     raw.drop_channels(useless_chs)\n\n    if standard_channels is not None and len(standard_channels) == len(raw.ch_names):\n        try:\n            raw.reorder_channels(standard_channels)\n        except:\n            return None, ['a']\n\n\n    raw = raw.filter(l_freq=l_freq, h_freq=h_freq)\n    raw = raw.notch_filter(50.0)\n    # downsampling\n    raw = raw.resample(sfreq, n_jobs=5)\n    used=[]\n    for i in range(len(raw.ch_names)):\n        raw.ch_names[i] = raw.ch_names[i].replace(\"EEG \", \"\")\n        raw.ch_names[i] = raw.ch_names[i].replace(\"-LE\", \"\")\n        raw.ch_names[i] = raw.ch_names[i].replace(\"-REF\", \"\")\n        if raw.ch_names[i] in standard_channels:\n            used.append(raw.ch_names[i])\n\n    eegData = raw.get_data(units='uV')\n\n    return eegData, used","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/2601771786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/3381810974","html_url":"https://github.com/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8#issuecomment-3381810974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/8","id":3381810974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLF0fBs7Jklce","user":{"login":"Stevetich","id":51825648,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxODI1NjQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51825648?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich","html_url":"https://github.com/Stevetich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stevetich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T14:27:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T14:27:00Z","body":"@TheNorthS Have u solved this problem? I have encountered the same problem, but it seems to be about channel numbers. As they have mentioned above, EEG data with different channels need to be organized within one hd5dataset file, respectively.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/935963004/LaBraM/issues/comments/3381810974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]